This repository is not under a single licence.  It is a learning project built
by following a book, so parts of it are original work and parts are derived
from someone else's.  The two are separated below.

===============================================================================
1. ORIGINAL WORK - MIT
===============================================================================

Everything in handmade/code EXCEPT stb_image.h (see section 3), plus the
README, the build scripts, the repository layout, and handmade/misc/cubes.mp4.
That is the X11/ALSA platform layer, the OpenGL extension loading, the maths
library, the camera, the WAV parser, the shader compilation and hot reloading,
and the game layer that drives them.

