===============================================================================
2. SHADERS - CC BY-NC 4.0, NOT MIT
===============================================================================

The GLSL in handmade/data (*.vert, *.frag) is derived from the code samples in
LearnOpenGL.  The Phong lighting maths, the Material and Light structs, the
lighting map sampling and the spotlight intensity formula follow the book
closely enough to count as derivative work, so its licence applies to them and
MIT above does NOT.

    Code samples copyright (c) Joey de Vries
    https://learnopengl.com
    https://twitter.com/JoeyDeVriez

    Licensed under CC BY-NC 4.0:
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

NonCommercial.  These files may be used, studied and modified, but not used
commercially without permission from the copyright holder.

