===============================================================================
4. WORK THAT INFLUENCED THIS BUT IS NOT REPRODUCED
===============================================================================

Handmade Hero, by Casey Muratori (https://handmadehero.org)
    The platform layer's architecture follows his design - the
    game-as-a-reloadable-library split, the game_memory / game_input interface,
    the memory arena, the input recording system.  His source is not freely
    distributable and none of it appears here; the X11 implementation was
    written from scratch against a different set of APIs.

xcb_handmade, by Neil Blakey-Milner and contributors (BSD licensed)
    https://github.com/nxsy/xcb_handmade
    Consulted while writing the Linux platform layer.  That project targets XCB
    and this one targets Xlib.

===============================================================================
5. ASSETS
===============================================================================

No models, textures, audio or PDFs are distributed in this repository.  They
are gitignored, and the README lists the ones the renderer expects with links
to their sources.  cube.obj is the exception - written
here, and covered by section 1.  Nothing here grants any right to anything
else.
